SemaphoreSlim
SemaphoreSlim is a lightweight implementation of semaphore. It throttles access to a
protected resource to a number of threads.
Here is a slim version of the semaphore program that we showed earlier in this chapter:
private static void ThrottlerUsingSemaphoreSlim()
{
var range = Enumerable.Range(1, 12);
SemaphoreSlim semaphore = new SemaphoreSlim(3, 3);
range.AsParallel().AsOrdered().ForAll(i =>
{
try
{
semaphore.Wait();
Console.WriteLine($"Index {i} making service call using
Task {Task.CurrentId}");
//Simulate Http call
CallService(i);
Console.WriteLine($"Index {i} releasing semaphore using
Task {Task.CurrentId}");
}
finally
{
semaphore.Release();
}
});
}
private static void CallService(int i)
{
Thread.Sleep(1000);
}
